<title>NETHERLANDS: Polynorm acquires 51 pct of French firm.</title>
<headline>Polynorm acquires 51 pct of French firm.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Plastics processor Polynorm said on Monday it had signed a letter of intent to acquire 51 percent of French Blocfer from January, 1997. </p>
<p>Polynorm said that the French firm was profitable and that it employs 125 staff.</p>
<p>No financial details were given on the deal.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
